# The dashboard lives here too, under dashboard/ — it has its own .gitignore
# for build output. It used to be a separate repository; its history was
# imported as a subtree on 2026-08-08.

# Claude Code local config
.claude/

# Credentials / signing secrets — never commit these anywhere in the tree
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.keystore
*.jks
*.mobileprovision
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# LINE bot credentials. `line_test.py` carries a hardcoded channel token as a
# default argument and `line_jyw.py` / `line bot.txt` hold RSA private keys for
# the v2.1 JWT flow — a `git add -A` would publish all three. The real values
# belong in Lambda environment variables; see line/README.md.
line_test.py
line_jyw.py
line bot.txt
py/
